  "operative_text": "SECTION 1 (HRS 134-7): No person who is charged with a felony in a court in this State or elsewhere, or has been convicted in this State or elsewhere of having committed a felony, or any crime of violence, or an illegal sale of any drug shall own, possess, or control any firearm or ammunition therefor."
